                            ["id"] = 263,
                            ["furnitureId"] = 4241,
                            ["description"] = "The sabre cats of northern Tamriel are possibly even more powerful than their southern Senche cousins. They are certainly more feral and difficult to train. \n|cFFFFFF\nRiding Skill does not affect this mount's appearance.|r",
