                            ["id"] = 10919,
                            ["furnitureId"] = 8683,
                            ["description"] = "\"Swirls of velvety purple. Curved horns. Eyes glowing as they stared down at me. Did I still dream? Had I eaten the wrong mushroom? But no, I was awake. Ah, Vaermina. I delight in serving you, but this gift interrupts my studies.\"—Malven Relas's Journal",
