                            ["name"] = "Ja'zennji Siir Fox",
                            ["id"] = 8906,
                            ["furnitureId"] = 7519,
                            ["description"] = "\"A hint of playfulness. A touch of joy. An aura of mystery. These mix under Jode's light and take the form of a masked fox who seeks out these traits in their next rider. Or so the priests say. But maybe they've had too much moon-sugar.\"—Sulema",
