                            ["id"] = 5096,
                            ["furnitureId"] = 4981,
                            ["description"] = "The first Guar came to Artaeum when a Psijic advisor to the Tribunal returned from Mournhold with a Pony Guar in the middle of the First Era, and they've been favorites of the Psijics ever since. There's even a glowing Psijic Mascot Guar!",
