                            ["id"] = 5847,
                            ["furnitureId"] = 5591,
                            ["description"] = "\"The recesses of our nightmares contain horrors that we often cannot look at. Yet we must, lest these pockets of terror fester and grow. To light your path, I present this bantam guar. Please do not squeal.\" — Overheard in a dark alley",
