                            ["id"] = 5848,
                            ["furnitureId"] = 5592,
                            ["description"] = "When asked about the rumor that the Hot-Blooded Bantam Guar had been bred as a vampiric sub-species by the disgraced mage Darvasen before he was exiled from Shad Astula, Arch-Mage Valeyn replied, \"What nonsense! They just like to eat tomatoes. Trust me.\"",
