                            ["name"] = "Mossy Vvardvark",
                            ["id"] = 9450,
                            ["furnitureId"] = 7845,
                            ["description"] = "\"Now, surely the presence of this creature is enough to dissuade those pompous academics from believing magic created the first Vvardvark. Who would create a creature so listless that moss grows on it?\"—Atmore, Vvardenfell Zoological Field Commission",
