                            ["id"] = 8037,
                            ["furnitureId"] = 6789,
                            ["description"] = "\"Noble ponies trot forth from Sovngarde, seeking those who have made oaths, knowingly or not. Curiosity prompts them to follow an oathmaker to see how they fulfill their promise. If one follows you, give it an apple. They love them.\"—Clever Woman Moritra",
